     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">Hi,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">I am Ayush Pandey, junior undergraduate at IIT Kharagpur pursuing Mathematics &amp; Computing Sciences.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">While browsing through R projects for GSoc&#39;15, I found <a href=\"https://github.com/rstats-gsoc/gsoc2015/wiki/Convex-optimization-modeling-language\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstats-gsoc/gsoc2015/wiki/Convex-optimization-modeling-language&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351668652000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0V4DCkfqgPnH0cBnD0BqK5\">Convex optimization modeling language</a> project interesting and something very exciting to work on. I have recently taken course on Operation Research in which i have mainly studied Linear Programming(<a href=\"https://github.com/Ayush-iitkgp/Linear-Programming\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/Ayush-iitkgp/Linear-Programming&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351668652000&amp;usg=AOvVaw068GhDi3GYN6ixTJ4o2IN9\">Github</a>). I think this project is the extension of what i have studied and pretty much will to work on it. <br><br>But sadly there is no mentor assigned for this project, will the mentor be assigned to me by the organisation ? Please guide me what can be done in this regard so that i can work towards a successful GSoc project. </div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\"><br></div><br clear=\"all\"><div><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><b><span></span><span></span>Yours Sincerely,</b></span></div><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><b>Ayush Pandey</b><b>     <